<title>USA: Kaye Group buys California insurance firm.</title>
<headline>Kaye Group buys California insurance firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kaye Group Inc, an insurance holding company, said Monday it has purchased through a subsidiary Western Insurance Associates Inc, of Pasadena, Calif., for $2.9 million.</p>
<p>Western, founded in 1933, specializes in the so-called association insurance business and its clients include several church denominations and more than 150 reiterment community operators in western states, Kaye Group said.</p>
</text>
